WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.621
The inventory lists every screenshot the docs use. Both of these were handed off for P1 0.20.0.

00:00:07.721 --> 00:00:28.783
The watch command checks everything Pantheon ships, plus the release notes, against what it saw last time. P1's SDK went from 0.20.0 to 0.20.1, and both screenshots are still in progress for the older version. New release notes are listed with their tags; ones tagged User interface point at dashboard screenshots.

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:37.043
Release check for 0.20.1 lists both screenshots as behind, with the command that retargets each one.

00:00:38.043 --> 00:00:43.164
Approving a screenshot for 0.20.1 tells the capture step to shoot it again.

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.664
Same for the workstream selector.

00:00:46.724 --> 00:00:53.905
Update saves what the watch saw, so the next check only shows newer releases. Nothing is captured until a person approves it.
